  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 7.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "Hi doctor, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.77,
      "end_seconds": 13.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.6,
      "end_seconds": 20.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "It's trouble sleeping. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.12,
      "end_seconds": 24.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "How long are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.81,
      "end_seconds": 30.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "It's been going on for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.26,
      "end_seconds": 39.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.36,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.94,
      "end_seconds": 61.09,
      "duration_seconds": 17.15,
      "text": "only a warm bath, and it's not much. Moderate, really. Well, as for feeling irritable, I honestly can't say when that began. It It might have been last month or the month before"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.45,
      "end_seconds": 65.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.06,
      "end_seconds": 80.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "just relax your arm.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.94,
      "end_seconds": 102.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.75,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 127 over 78, pulse 84, SpO2 97 percent on room air. And what about night sweats or restless legs?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.57,
      "end_seconds": 105.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.82,
      "end_seconds": 112.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Right, and what about snoring, low mood or heavy caffeine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.78,
      "end_seconds": 116.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "um, nothing like that, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.22,
      "end_seconds": 118.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "And then?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.68,
      "end_seconds": 123.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.66,
      "end_seconds": 127.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.46,
      "end_seconds": 132.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.93,
      "end_seconds": 134.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.36,
      "end_seconds": 152.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "So, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.66,
      "end_seconds": 155.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.88,
      "end_seconds": 159.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "what's your current medication list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.51,
      "end_seconds": 166.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "Losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.9,
      "end_seconds": 170.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.7,
      "end_seconds": 173.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "About three months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.29,
      "end_seconds": 175.17,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "And then?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.11,
      "end_seconds": 184.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "I'm on melatonin, 3 milligrams, at night. I used to take telmisartan, but I stopped it it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.46,
      "end_seconds": 197.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.28,
      "end_seconds": 203.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Yes, eggs, it gives me stomach cramps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.15,
      "end_seconds": 207.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "anything special about your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.31,
      "end_seconds": 212.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I try to avoid too much sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.36,
      "end_seconds": 215.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Any sport or activity?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.88,
      "end_seconds": 218.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "I play badminton on Sundays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.56,
      "end_seconds": 221.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "are you still working?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.9,
      "end_seconds": 227.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "I'm retired now, I was a clerk for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.8,
      "end_seconds": 234.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.91,
      "end_seconds": 247.02,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about a year. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.55,
      "end_seconds": 256.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "So, based on your history, it points towards insomnia, probably stress-related. I'd also keep sleep apnoea in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.07,
      "end_seconds": 292.31,
      "duration_seconds": 18.24,
      "text": "Let's get a sleep study, for insomnia. Same wake-up time every day, no screens in the hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.04,
      "end_seconds": 295.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Okay, fair enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.48,
      "end_seconds": 303.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "I'd like you back in four weeks that's it on my side anything unclear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.67,
      "end_seconds": 311.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.79,
      "end_seconds": 313.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
